WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.980
Marvel has officially begun spinning its latest
web.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.900
Snaps of Black Widow actress Scarlett Johansson
on the set of the upcoming superhero standalone

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.120
hit the internet on Wednesday, confirming
that production is now underway in Sæbø,

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.120
Norway.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.800
The photographs themselves, some shared by
Norwegian news outlet Dagbladet and others

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.610
uploaded by NRK, feature Johansson doing normal
actor-type things while filming a movie and

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.640
aren't all that interesting, if we're being
totally candid here.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.980
She's seen filming scenes where Natasha Romanoff
does relatively unremarkable stuff: she pops

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:37.280
into a local convenience store, puts bags
in a car, and takes a ferry to an unknown

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.280
destination.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.640
No one else that Marvel fans would recognize
can be spotted on the set, so it seems that

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:47.240
Black Widow director Cate Shortland may be
getting some of Johansson's solo scenes completed

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.280
first.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.900
Something that is of note, however, is Johansson's
hair color.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:57.260
In the pictures, she sports Natasha's signature
red tresses which offers a clue as to when

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.260
the Black Widow movie takes place.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.160
The only time Black Widow didn't have completely
red hair in the MCU was when she rocked a

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:08.660
blonde bob in Avengers: Infinity War, and
when she sported a half-blonde, half-ginger

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:12.360
hairdo after the five-year time jump in Avengers:
Endgame.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:16.780
Given that Black Widow sacrificed herself
in Avengers: Endgame, throwing herself off

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:20.570
the cliff on Vormir so that Hawkeye could
retrieve the Soul Stone and help complete

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:25.159
the Avengers' time heist mission, the only
option for the Black Widow film's time setting

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.200
is the past.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.340
Her hair color in these set photos backs up
that notion.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:34.159
It also seems to corroborate previous reports
claiming that Black Widow is a prequel film

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:39.100
set in two different time periods, one that
follows Natasha during her time spent working

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:44.360
as a state secret agent for the KGB, and another
that picks up 15 years after the dissolution

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.580
of the Soviet Union, which happened in 1991.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:52.439
This would mean that Black Widow would partially
take place during Natasha's teenage years,

00:01:52.439 --> 00:01:57.619
then document her trials and triumphs in the
year 2006 as she forms her own identity and

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.360
finds her way in the U.S.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:04.780
Since Johansson's Black Widow didn't debut
in the Marvel Cinematic Universe until 2010,

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:09.510
first appearing in the Iron Man sequel, there's
plenty of time to range over and gaps in the

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.740
hero's on-screen story to fill.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:16.360
On the flip side, some have speculated that
perhaps the solo movie is set in the more

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:21.420
recent past, the five years between Avengers:
Infinity War and Avengers: Endgame.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.620
Geeks WorldWide writer Thomas Polito theorized
on Twitter that the upcoming film could see

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.349
Black Widow training her replacement, referring
to a different secret agent character from

00:02:31.349 --> 00:02:33.980
the comics who first appeared in the late-90s:

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:39.099
"Theory: The film takes place between Infinity
War and Endgame, and features Nat training

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:44.060
a new Black Widow (Yelena Belova, perhaps?)
who will factor into future movies.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.520
Flashbacks to Nat’s past will be sprinkled
throughout the film as well."

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:53.160
It's not hard to see how this theory could
work: Avengers: Endgame showed audiences that

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:57.400
while the other Avengers went on their own
journeys after the snap, Black Widow was trying

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:01.629
to keep things together and continue protecting
the world in the event of another massive

00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:02.420
threat.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.060
She organized meetings with other still-active
heroes, and even tracked down Hawkeye to bring

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:07.880
him home.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:12.480
It wouldn't be the craziest thing to think
that Natasha used a few years after the Snap

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:16.819
and before the time heist to train another
heroine to take her place, should something

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:17.760
happen to her.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:22.680
Conjecture aside, there's one thing about
Black Widow of which we are certain: Johansson

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.080
will reportedly share the screen with a shining
group of stars.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.939
Fighting with My Family and Midsommar actress
Florence Pugh, The Handmaid's Tale actor O-T

00:03:30.939 --> 00:03:35.879
Fagbenle, Stranger Things and Hellboy actor
David Harbour, and Academy Award-winner Rachel

00:03:35.879 --> 00:03:40.360
Weisz are all said have joined the cast of
Black Widow or have otherwise been in talks

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.340
to do so.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:46.959
According to a March 2019 article from The
Hollywood Reporter, Pugh's character has arguably

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.640
the biggest part to play.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:54.580
She's described as, quote, "a spy on the same
level as [Black Widow], likely her moral opposite."

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.400
Will Pugh's character be a new Black Widow
in training?

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.460
Will she be her number-one competition within
the KGB?

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.760
Could she be both?

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:05.280
No matter what the story turns out to be,
we're excited to find out.

